OL,5,G1200 Reuben: Life in the Dales
OL,6,     FThe friends join Reuben's
OL,7,     Ffirst-ever holiday abroad on a
OL,8,     Froad trip through north France,
OL,9,     Ftaking in vineyards, camping,
OL,10,     Fdriving a French vintage tractor
OL,11,     Fand go-karting at Le Mans
OL,12,     Fracetrack! (Ep4)
OL,13,G1300 Reuben: Life in the Dales
OL,14,     FReuben plans to sell old machinery
OL,15,     Fat a local auction, but his
OL,16,     Fvintage tractor refuses to start.
OL,17,     FSarah upcycles an old plough, and
OL,18,     FReuben and Tommy weld together a
OL,19,     Fcow scraper. (Ep5)
